    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Discreetly tucked away within a quiet and highly sought-after cul-de-sac in the heart of Ranelagh, 1A Chester Road presents a rare opportunity to acquire a quirky, unique home offering exceptional potential. Distinctive in both character and setting, this unique residence offers the discerning purchaser an exciting blank canvas from which to create a truly bespoke home in one of Dublin's most desirable and vibrant neighbourhoods.\r\n\r\nWhile requiring renovation and modernisation, the property possesses all the ingredients for an exciting transformation. Its flexible accommodation and distinctive layout provide enormous scope for reimagining and redesigning to suit contemporary living, allowing a new owner to place their own stamp on the property.\r\n\r\nA particular feature is the private south-facing courtyard garden, a great outdoor space enjoying excellent natural sunlight throughout the day. \r\n\r\nThe location is highly convenient, Chester Road is a quiet residential enclave just off Oxford Road and moments from the vibrant atmosphere of Ranelagh Village, where an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, boutiques and neighbourhood amenities are all within a gentle stroll. The Luas is quite literally on the doorstep, providing swift access to Dublin City Centre, while Belgrave Square offers an attractive green oasis nearby.\r\n\r\nCombining location, potential and individuality, 1A Chester Road represents a rare opportunity to create a bespoke home in one of Dublin's most desirable and convenient neighbourhoods."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "GFCH\r\nSouth Facing Courtyard Garden with Pedestrian Rear Access\r\nIdeally located within a stones’ throw of both Ranelagh and Rathmines villages\r\nA short walk to the Ranelagh & Charlemont Luas Stops"
      },
